      en: ["The reserve was founded in 1992 and became a UNESCO World Heritage site in 1996.", "It covers an area of 13,726 square kilometers.", "Approximately one-fifth of the Ituri Forest is located within the reserve.", "The reserve is home to approximately 5,000 okapi.", "It has been on the List of World Heritage in Danger since 1997.", "The okapi was only discovered by Western scientists in 1901."],
      es: ["Fundada en 1992.", "Superficie: 14.000 km².", "Situada en la provincia de Ituri.", "Patrimonio de la Humanidad desde 1996.", "Población estimada de okapis: 5.000 animales.", "Hogar de los pigmeos Mbuti."],
      pt: ["Fundada em 1992.", "Área: 14.000 km².", "Situada na província de Ituri.", "Património Mundial da UNESCO desde 1996.", "População estimada de ocapis: 5.000 animais.", "Lar dos pigmeus Mbuti."],
